                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2851395-ef35-3a41-a483-2af8c3096877",
                        "entry_id": "babbe401-e4a4-323d-9e6b-ccb54d3d96d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "extreme extent"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "inanimate",
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4c81c24-5d15-423b-af8b-46612b85a86b",
                                "sense_id": "f2851395-ef35-3a41-a483-2af8c3096877",
                                "text": "Он был в замеча́тельном настрое́нии — когда́ Тата́рский с поро́га протяну́л ему́ конве́рт, Ха́нин нахму́рил бро́ви и махну́л руко́й, как бы в оби́де на таку́ю делови́тость, но пря́мо на излёте э́того же́ста вы́нул конве́рт из руки́ Тата́рского и сра́зу же куда́-то спря́тал.",
                                "translation": "He was in an excellent mood -when Tatarsky held out the envelope to him from the doorway, Khanin knitted his brows and waved it aside, as though offended at such a brusque businesslike entrance, but at the extreme extent of the gesture he lifted the envelope out of Tatarsky’s fingers and immediately tucked it away somewhere.",
                                "english": "He was in an excellent mood -when Tatarsky held out the envelope to him from the doorway, Khanin knitted his brows and waved it aside, as though offended at such a brusque businesslike entrance, but at the extreme extent of the gesture he lifted the envelope out of Tatarsky’s fingers and immediately tucked it away somewhere."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
